<title>JAPAN: BOXING-VENEZUELA'S BONILLA RETAINS WBA FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-VENEZUELA'S BONILLA RETAINS WBA FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jose Bonilla of Venezuela retained</p>
<p>his World Boxing Association (WBA) flyweight title when the</p>
<p>referee stopped the fight against Japan's Hiroki Ioka in the</p>
<p>seventh round of their scheduled 12-round bout on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
